---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About · Muhammad Shahzaib"
  description="Bio, curriculum vitae, hardware workbench, and engineering background of Muhammad Shahzaib."
>
  <div class="about-page section-spacing">
    <div class="container">
      {/* Bio Header */}
      <div class="asym-grid asym-grid-57" style="margin-bottom: 4rem;">
        <div>
          <span class="chapter-num">Biography & Philosophy</span>
          <h1>Muhammad Shahzaib</h1>
          <p class="narrative-lead" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
            I built the website for Arbotrix, a robotics company. Based in Islamabad, I build software systems that translate logical code into cyber-physical motion.
          </p>

          <p style="margin-top: 1rem; line-height: 1.7;">
            My work lives at the intersection of embedded robotics hardware and high-performance web software. I write ROS 2 navigation stacks that run on headless NVIDIA Jetson Linux single-board computers, and the responsive Flutter and Next.js applications that let human operators teleoperate, inspect, and supervise them over local networks.
          </p>

          <p style="margin-top: 1rem; line-height: 1.7;">
            I believe that software engineering is not about accumulating framework buzzwords—it is about designing resilient systems under genuine constraints: bandwidth drops, hardware latency, concurrency contention, and thread budgets.
          </p>

          <div class="about-quick-meta font-mono" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
            <div class="q-item">
              <span class="q-label">Arbotrix Project:</span>
              <span class="q-val">Built the company website</span>
            </div>
            <div class="q-item">
              <span class="q-label">Education:</span>
              <span class="q-val">BS Computer Science · Iqra University</span>
            </div>
            <div class="q-item">
              <span class="q-label">Availability:</span>
              <span class="q-val" style="color: #10B981;">Immediate / Q4 2026 – 2027 Roles</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="profile-card surface-card">
            <img 
              src="/images/shahzaib-arbo.webp" 
              alt="Muhammad Shahzaib"
              class="profile-img"
              loading="eager"
            />
            <div class="profile-caption font-mono">
              <span style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-main);">Muhammad Shahzaib</span>
              <span style="color: var(--accent-orange);">Robotics & Full-Stack Software Engineer</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Hardware & Workbench Setup */}
      <section style="margin-bottom: 5rem; padding-top: 3rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);">
        <span class="chapter-num">Hardware & Lab Environment</span>
        <h2>Physical Workbench & Lab Inventory</h2>
        <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
          To build software that bridges logic to motion, I maintain an active physical hardware and embedded robotics testing lab:
        </p>

        <div class="hardware-grid">
          <div class="hw-item surface-card font-mono">
            <span class="hw-category">Compute & Edge AI</span>
            <h4>NVIDIA Jetson Orin Nano</h4>
            <p>6-core ARM Cortex-A78AE, 1024-core NVIDIA Ampere GPU. Runs headless Ubuntu 22.04 LTS with ROS 2 Humble.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="hw-item surface-card font-mono">
            <span class="hw-category">Real-Time Control</span>
            <h4>ESP32 & STM32 Dual-Core</h4>
            <p>Dedicated FreeRTOS microcontroller boards handling quadrature encoder pulses, PID interrupts, and motor PWM.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="hw-item surface-card font-mono">
            <span class="hw-category">Perception & Sensors</span>
            <h4>2D 360° LiDAR & IMUs</h4>
            <p>12m range laser distance scanners, MPU-6050 6-axis inertial measurement units, and Hall-effect wheel encoders.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="hw-item surface-card font-mono">
            <span class="hw-category">Chassis & Kinematics</span>
            <h4>Differential Drive Testbeds</h4>
            <p>Custom 2-wheel driven prototypes with forward/rear casters for indoor odometry benchmarking and teleoperation.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* Résumé / CV Section */}
      <section id="resume" style="padding-top: 3rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
          <div>
            <span class="chapter-num">Curriculum Vitae</span>
            <h2>Professional Experience & Credentials</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="resume-cta-buttons" style="display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
            <a 
              href="/Shahzaib_Resume.pdf" 
              download="Shahzaib_Resume.pdf"
              class="btn btn-primary font-mono"
              style="font-size: 0.8125rem;"
            >
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path>
                <polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline>
                <line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line>
              </svg>
              <span>Download CV (PDF)</span>
            </a>
            <a 
              href="/Shahzaib_Resume.pdf" 
              target="_blank" 
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="btn btn-secondary font-mono"
              style="font-size: 0.8125rem;"
            >
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"></path>
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle>
              </svg>
              <span>View in Browser</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="resume-sheet surface-card">
          {/* Header */}
          <div class="sheet-header">
            <div>
              <h3 style="font-size: 1.75rem;">Muhammad Shahzaib</h3>
              <p class="font-mono" style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--accent-orange); margin-top: 0.25rem;">
                Software Engineer · Robotics, Systems & Full-Stack
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="sheet-contact font-mono">
              <span>mr.shahzaib25005@gmail.com</span>
              <span>github.com/MrShahzaib005</span>
              <span>linkedin.com/in/mr-shahzaib</span>
              <span>Islamabad, Pakistan</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          {/* Experience */}
          <div class="sheet-section">
            <span class="sheet-sec-title font-mono">Experience & Selected Projects</span>

            <div class="exp-item">
              <div class="exp-header">
                <div>
                  <strong>Arbotrix Company Website</strong> · <span class="font-mono">Selected Project</span>
                </div>
                <span class="exp-date font-mono">Project</span>
              </div>
              <ul class="sheet-bullet-list">
                <li>Built the website for Arbotrix, a robotics company.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="exp-item" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
              <div class="exp-header">
                <div>
                  <strong>Lead Backend Architect (FYP)</strong> · <span class="font-mono">Buddy: Multi-Tenant Agentic AI</span>
                </div>
                <span class="exp-date font-mono">2026 — Present</span>
              </div>
              <ul class="sheet-bullet-list">
                <li>Engineered a Java 23 & Spring Boot 3.x multi-agent orchestration architecture using LangChain4j and local Ollama (Llama 3.1 8B) inference.</li>
                <li>Designed dynamic tenant isolation using Java <code>ThreadLocal</code> security contexts and PostgreSQL pgvector filters, preventing cross-tenant data retrieval across 1,000 synthetic test runs.</li>
                <li>Implemented prompt-level schema sandboxing to strip tool payloads during general conversation, mathematically eliminating unauthorized writes on small models.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          {/* Education */}
          <div class="sheet-section" style="margin-top: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light); padding-top: 1.5rem;">
            <span class="sheet-sec-title font-mono">Education</span>
            <div class="exp-header">
              <div>
                <strong>Bachelor of Science in Computer Science (BSCS)</strong> · <span class="font-mono">Iqra University</span>
              </div>
              <span class="exp-date font-mono">Expected 2026</span>
            </div>
            <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 0.35rem;">
              Focus: Distributed Systems, Operating Systems, Database Architecture, Machine Learning, and Cyber-Physical Robotics.
            </p>
          </div>

          {/* Core Technical Competencies */}
          <div class="sheet-section" style="margin-top: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light); padding-top: 1.5rem;">
            <span class="sheet-sec-title font-mono">Core Technical Competencies</span>
            <div class="skills-grid font-mono">
              <div>
                <strong style="color: var(--text-main);">Robotics & Middleware:</strong>
                <p>ROS 2 Humble, Gazebo Garden, Nav2, SLAM Toolbox, URDF/Xacro, rosbridge_suite, TF2</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong style="color: var(--text-main);">Languages:</strong>
                <p>Python, C++, Java 23, Dart, TypeScript, JavaScript, SQL, Shell Scripting</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong style="color: var(--text-main);">Web & Backend:</strong>
                <p>Next.js 16, React 19, Spring Boot 3.x, LangChain4j, Flutter, Prisma, PostgreSQL, pgvector</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong style="color: var(--text-main);">Systems & DevOps:</strong>
                <p>Linux (Ubuntu 22.04 LTS), Git, Docker, FreeRTOS, UART/Serial, SSH, Jetson Orin Nano</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-quick-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background-color: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
  }

  .q-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .q-label {
    color: var(--text-faint);
    width: 110px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  .q-val {
    color: var(--text-main);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .profile-card {
    padding: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .profile-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 6px;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 18%;
    aspect-ratio: 4/5;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .profile-caption {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0 0.25rem;
  }

  .hardware-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .hw-item {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .hw-category {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    color: var(--accent-orange);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .hw-item h4 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .hw-item p {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  /* Resume Sheet */
  .resume-sheet {
    padding: clamp(1.75rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    background-color: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
  }

  .sheet-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-strong);
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .sheet-header {
      flex-direction: row;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }

  .sheet-contact {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .sheet-sec-title {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-faint);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .exp-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .exp-date {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }

  .sheet-bullet-list {
    list-style: square;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .skills-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .skills-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .skills-grid p {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }
</style>
